# VOICES (ENV): each voice's LEVEL, TONE, character and SPACE, kept with the settings. PULSE's level
# down (the kick sits under the drone); held, a button says what it does and does nothing else; an idle
# page goes home after 30 s.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap ENV
expect view 1
turn SELECT 2
turn K1 -10
expect voice31 60
shot voices.png
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect voice31 60
listen
press PLAY
wait 900
release PLAY
wait 100
said START, STOP
expect playing 0
tap FX
expect view 4
turn K1 3
shot fx.png
wait 31000
expect view 0
